      "content": "everything i've built is just... gone. three years of my life, every cent i had, just evaporated. i feel like there's this law of nature i can't escape, like everything i touch just starts to decay immediately. it's not even a bad luck thing anymore, it feels like a mathematical certainty. i'm just a source of entropy.",
